\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \ul Version 6.2 (2023/04/02)\
\

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \ulnone - New Feature: Tab Groups\
  Tab Groups can be used to save all the Tabs of a window as a unit (group) so the groups can be re-opened later again easily again. Open tab groups will automatically remember all the changes within the group (like links which were opened, tabs opened or closed etc), so when re-opening a group, their latest state will be restored. Tab Groups can be managed via new \'84Tabs\'93 menu and via sidebar.\
\
- New Feature: Sidebar\
  It is now possible to have a sidebar in browser windows (via \'84View\'93 menu or via button in the browser toolbar). The sidebar allows easy access to the \'84page overview\'93 (directly jump to each section or paragraph of the current web page), the \'84link overview\'93 (list of all links of a web page), and the \'84tab groups\'93 (easy access to tab groups).\
\
- New Feature: QR Codes\
  All links, bookmarks, etc within the App can be displayed as QR code from within the contextual menus. This makes it easy to open them in a smartphone because it is possible to scan the addresses instead of typing them in manually. The QR codes can be also saved as file by simply dragging them to the Finder.\
\
- Bugfix: a workaround for a bug of the macOS solves issues with \'84data\'93 URLs which include a fragment identifier\
- Bugfix: \'84data\'93 URLs did not work when used directly in the address bar\
- Bugfix: Mac AppStore links should now open correctly within the Mac AppStore App\
\

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \ul \
Version 6.1.5 (2022/12/21)\

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \ulnone \
- New Option available in the \'84Windows/Tabs\'93 settings which allows to open new windows with a hidden tabs toolbar\
- Improved save/fill out forms features which works with more web sites. For the form-based fill-out feature it is now possible to use wildcards (\'84*\'93 and \'93?\'93) within the URL and action parameters to make them more general.\
- When Printing or saving web pages as PDF while being in reading mode the Toolbar with the reading mode options will be hidden now.\
- New option \'84Duplicate Tab\'93  added to the File menu and the contextual menu of Tabs\
- New option \'84Lock Tabs\'93 added to the File menu and the contextual menu of Tabs. Locked Tabs can not be closed without an additional confirmation and can\'92t be overridden via address field or bookmarks. The App might open a new tab instead.\
- New option in the \'84General\'93 settings added, which can be used to enable an additional conformation whenever deleting anything within the App. This can be useful if you tend to activate the \'84delete\'93 option by accident.\
- Added a new Module to redirect \'84YouTube Shorts\'93 to the regular Youtube video player (for all users who find the Shorts video player too primitive and uncomfortable)\
\
- Bugfix: The auto-update of AdBlock Plus filters will now no longer activate filters lists which were deactivated before.\
- Bugfix: In case the configured Downloads folder does no longer exist (for example it lies on an external drive that is not connected, or the older was deleted) the App will use the default one of the macOS.\
- Bugfix: Handoff didn\'92t work if iCab was not running already\
- Bugfix: Recognizes some more file types that can not be displayed as \'84downloads\'93\
\

