- For CSS-based filters iCab is now supporting the special rules  \'84:has-text()\'93 und \'84:upwards()\'93 from the \'84uBlock\'93 ad blocker  \
- Under macOS 11/12 the mode \'84Text + Icon\'93 was not preserved across App launches.\
- Under macOS 11/12 it could happen that toolbar icons were shown slightly distorted if the display did not support \'84Retina\'93 resolutions\
